                                                "sense_id": "58c1319c-e58c-3c5f-9e13-e86cd19ede51",
                                                "text": "Finally, the test was baselined by evaluating the best and poorest catalysts of their respective types by this protocol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53add203-a081-46da-a328-90e18af24860",
                                                "sense_id": "58c1319c-e58c-3c5f-9e13-e86cd19ede51",
                                                "text": "To ensure Lojban remains stable while people learn it, the language definition is being closely controlled; the grammar and core vocabulary have already been baselined (frozen) for several years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9d05260-5b2c-3ab5-9437-7fea71260056",
                                        "entry_id": "c556b4b4-4178-30dc-a29b-02c8f96fe658",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play from the baseline."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "352811c4-d33c-46e9-a0c2-dbf901394886",
                                                "sense_id": "a9d05260-5b2c-3ab5-9437-7fea71260056",
                                                "text": "By the time Maggie, who is eight years younger than Manuela, started playing, baselining was no longer enough to win points, so she learned to move around the court more …"
                                            }
